{"articleNo":"86726","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=86726&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014 멕시코정부초청 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.07.15","hit":"3587","attachments":[{"name":"지원서 양식 등.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=86726&attachNo=72481"},{"name":"1.2014 멕시코 정부초청 장학생 선발요강.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=86726&attachNo=72501"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 새굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림\">멕시코정부초청장학생을 아래와 같이 모집하오니 귀대학의 우수한 학생들이 많이 지원할 수 있도록 홍보하여주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2014 멕시코정부초청 장학생 선발요강 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 과정 및 선발예정인원</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 과정 : 석사 혹은 박사과정 또는 연구과정 (기간연장포함)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 석박사 통합과정, 예비과정, 원격교육과정은 지원 불가 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 최종선발인원 : 4명</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 본원 추천 인원 : 6명 (석사2, 박사2, 연구과정2, 지원자 현황에 따라 조정 가능)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 분야</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-치열교정술, 성형수술, 마케팅, 회계학, 광고학, 경영학 등을 제외한 모든 분야</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 394pt; HEIGHT: 45pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN: 0pt 0.9pt 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 새굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림\">※ </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 새굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림\">지원서양식, 자세한 자격요건 및 멕시코정부장학생을 수용하는 대학리스트는 &lt;붙임1-1&gt;, &lt;붙임1-2&gt;를 참조</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 새굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림\">하고, 대학별 학과/전공에 대한 구체적인 자료는 해당 학교의 웹사이트를 참조할 것</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><p></p><p></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 장학금 지급내역</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수업료 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 월생활비 (석사 7,771.20페소(약 $598.71), 박사 9,714페소(약 $748.38)) </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 5.7pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 의료보험 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 5.7pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ Mexican Social Security Institution(IMSS) 의료보험이며, 장학금 지급 시작 3개월 후부터 적용되며 질병은 보장되지 않음. </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 장학금 지급기간</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 석사과정 : 2년</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 박사과정 : 3년</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;* 장학금 지급기간은 연장을 불허하며, 수료후 석박사과정으로 연계될 수 없음. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 지원자격</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 대한민국 국적자 &nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 현재 멕시코거주 유학생 지원 불가 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 학사 또는 석사학위 소지자(2013.8월까지 취득 가능한 자 포함) </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 취득 학위(학/석사과정) 전과정 백분율 G.P.A. 80% 이상자</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5) 스페인어로 대학 수강이 가능한 자 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(스페인어 전공이 아닌 경우 상급 어학자격증 제출 요망)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 8.1pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 제출서류 및 기타 사항: 첨부 문서 참조</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 8.1pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 새굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 1.2014멕시코 정부초청장학생 선발요강 1부</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 2.지원서 양식 등 1부. 끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
